<article class="env-lemma" id="01GF">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01GF">Lemma <span data-tag="01GF">25.4.5</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a site with fibre products. Let $X$ be an object of $\mathcal{C}$. Let $K$ be a hypercovering of $X$. The homology of the simplicial presheaf $F(K)$ is $0$ in degrees $> 0$ and equal to $\mathbf{Z}_ X^\# $ in degree $0$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Lemmas <a href="/tag/01GE" data-tag="01GE">25.4.4</a> and <a href="/tag/01G9" data-tag="01G9">25.3.9</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>